<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-No Australia budget surplus in 97/98-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-No Australia budget surplus in 97/98-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday there was no chance the budget would be in surplus in 1997/98 (July-June).</p>
<p>&quot;But alas there is no chance that we'll be in a surplus next year or the year after,&quot; Costello told reporters.</p>
</text>
